   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>I am trying to call R from Java.  In R Script we have used R library &quot;RQuantLib&quot;, </div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">library(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0);font-weight:bold\">&quot;RQuantLib&quot;</span>)</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre></div><div>So I have added corresponding maven dependency for this in my pom.</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">dependency</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">groupId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>org.renjin.cran<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">groupId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">artifactId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>RQuantLib<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">artifactId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">version</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>0.4.2-b30<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">version</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">dependency</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">But I am struck with below error while execution.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; org.renjin.eval.EvalException: error in load action .__A__.1 for package RQuantLib: NULL: </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Could not load JVM class &#39;org.renjin.cran.RQuantLib.RQuantLib&#39; from package &#39;org.renjin.cran.RQuantLib.RQuantLib&#39;</span></font></strong></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">I couldn&#39;t get much information about this error in web.  So it would be great if you provide some help on this.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Thanks for your help in advance.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Thanks &amp; Regards,</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Karthik B</span></pre></div></div>"
