  {
   "id": "B3BXjsAXCQAJ",
   "from": "Maarten-Jan Kallen",
   "author": "39ae60762c088189",
   "date": "2017-01-19T10:53:19Z",
   "subject": "Re: Reg : Error in RQuantLib",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Karthik,<div><br></div><div>it looks like the RQuantlLib cannot be used in Renjin as the build system wasn&#39;t able to compile the sources to Java bytecode. You can see the same error message in one of the examples here: <a href=\"http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/RQuantLib/0.4.2/build/30#test-AmericanOption-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/RQuantLib/0.4.2/build/30%23test-AmericanOption-examples&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343561545000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bDlltO6IoTm_a4sv2cApg\">http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/RQuantLib/0.4.2/build/30#test-AmericanOption-examples</a></div><div><br></div><div>It seems that this package interfaces with QuantLib, which is a C++ library. The build system doesn&#39;t have this library installed and, even if it did, it will not be able to transpile this to Java bytecode. The same holds for other packages which depend on C libraries (e.g. libcurl, libxml, GNU scientific library, etc.) and our usual approach is to create &quot;replacement&quot; packages for these. This means that you would look for equivalent functionality in a Java library, but QuantLib seems very specific and this option is probably less obvious.</div><div><br></div><div>Maarten-Jan</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, January 19, 2017 at 11:42:27 AM UTC+1, karthik Baladhandapani wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>I am trying to call R from Java.  In R Script we have used R library &quot;RQuantLib&quot;, </div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">library(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0);font-weight:bold\">&quot;RQuantLib&quot;</span>)</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre></div><div>So I have added corresponding maven dependency for this in my pom.</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">dependency</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">groupId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>org.renjin.cran<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">groupId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">artifactId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>RQuantLib<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">artifactId</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">version</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span>0.4.2-b30<span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">version</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,128);font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">dependency</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">&gt;</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">But I am struck with below error while execution.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; org.renjin.eval.EvalException: error in load action .__A__.1 for package RQuantLib: NULL: </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Could not load JVM class &#39;org.renjin.cran.RQuantLib.RQuantLib&#39; from package &#39;org.renjin.cran.RQuantLib.RQuantLib&#39;</span></font></strong></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">I couldn&#39;t get much information about this error in web.  So it would be great if you provide some help on this.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Thanks for your help in advance.</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Thanks &amp; Regards,</span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:9pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(239,239,239)\">Karthik B</span></pre></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
